            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Cubert on his journey to reach his true love in <strong>Box Maze</strong>, a platforming adventure filled with challenging levels, dangerous enemies, hidden secrets, and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a variety of obstacles, collect cupcakes along the way, and use your enemies to your advantage. Test your memory and reflexes as you navigate fake and real doors, react quickly in time-based challenges, and uncover the secrets hidden throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/512020/extras/0d14efd2467c3cde380210be81849e36.avif?t=1784051359\" width=650 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming adventure with unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and boss encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay mechanics based on memory and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fake and real door puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based challenge levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >170 Steam Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character skins available as DLC.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: The game may contain secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 