                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Rating: 8.2/10\n\nBox Maze is a colorful arcade puzzle game that combines platforming, quick reflexes, and memory-based challenges into a surprisingly enjoyable experience. You take control of Cubert as he journeys through increasingly difficult mazes to rescue his true love, overcoming enemies, traps, and clever obstacles along the way. While the game is fairly simple, its variety of mechanics and steady increase in difficulty make it an entertaining indie title.",
